	(text "Whenever the \"Error\" state goes to low, the comparator timer goes low, \nsending a trailing edge to the trigger, pulling the output to low and\nstarting a countdown to reset the SDC Relay.\n\n555 Wait time calculated with compensation\nfor the RC discharge time."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 151.384 158.496 0)
		(effects
